     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Certainly building on the fly would be better. We&#39;re not well suited for that at the moment but it will be possible soon(-ish).<div><br></div><div>For now, the approach you&#39;re using is OK. You could use R but you wouldn&#39;t gain that much:</div><div><br></div><div><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,nimbussansl,liberationsans,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;overflow:visible;word-wrap:normal\">  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">custompopup5</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> paste0(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;b&gt;You selected: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">custompopup1</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">img</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span> width = &#39;100&#39;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);vertical-align:top;text-align:right;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-right-width:1px\"></td></tr></tbody></table><br>could become</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\">custompopup5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\"> lapply(custompopup1, function(popup) {</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">    as.character(div(</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">      h3(tags$b(&quot;You selected:&quot;)),</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">      popup,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">      tags$br(),</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">      tags$br(),</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">      tags$img(src=img, width=100)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">    ))</span></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18.2000007629395px;white-space:pre\">  })<br></span></font></div></div>"
