     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Friday, March 20, 2015 at 11:28:05 AM UTC-7, cho7tom wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Dear all,</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I am using <strong>R shiny</strong> to build web applications, and some of them are leveraging the great leaflet features.<br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I would like to create a <strong>customed and advanced popup</strong>, but I do not know how to proceed.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">You can see what I can do in the project I created for this post on <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/cho7tom/LeafletCustomedPopups\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cho7tom/LeafletCustomedPopups&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399695275000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1frKT9rbamvPQTDyUGD2my\">github</a></strong>, or directly in <strong><a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399695275000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HPHgrHp5ounbzgDPXQFqM\">shinyapp.io</a> <a href=\"https://cho7tom.shinyapps.io/LeafletCustomedPopups/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cho7tom.shinyapps.io/LeafletCustomedPopups/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399695275000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EoBVyunX3X5y5HnIQAiQ9\">here</a></strong